        <procedure title="Visits know your transactions page" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Visit Know Your Transactions Page</p>
            <p>Clicks the "Know Your Transactions" menu and verifies the correct route and heading are loaded.</p>
            <p><b>Priority:</b> Medium</p>
            <step>Click element with data-cy="know-your-transactions".</step>
            <step>Assert that the pathname is "/know-your-transactions/transactions".</step>
            <step>Verify that the page contains "Transaction Insights".</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• The Transaction Insights page is loaded and visible.</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
